    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan8_ZhanQinNiao_L001",
      "original_quote": "其法專責天禽星落宮下臨地盤之宮是何干以決之",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan8_ZhanQinNiao_L002",
      "original_quote": "若天禽落地盤得奇門吉格者吉",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan8_ZhanQinNiao_L003",
      "original_quote": "凶格者凶",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan8_ZhanQinNiao_L004",
      "original_quote": "各以八門配之",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan8_ZhanQinNiao_L005",
      "original_quote": "吉凶自驗",
      "tag": []
